    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little girl knocks on your door in the middle of a rainy night, asking for help. She doesn't remember anything, even her own name. Quickly, you take her in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e32349e91b348b24647908df36e564f8.avif?t=1746601913\" data-has-big width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle the challenge of raising a little girl into adulthood</strong> under the harsh conditions of a Brazilian favela.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the girl's adoptive father or mother!</strong><br><br>Despite the challenges of the location, live a regular life: buy her clothes, furniture and items for her bedroom, change her haircut and more!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/42961e867a476742b5d68149b29caf21.avif?t=1746601913\" data-has-big width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can befriend several kids and even date them later in the game! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks, read library books, attend classes and courses from the community center e and get a job for some extra cash! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to look around everywhere for hidden secrets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> This game has over 30 different endings!\u00a0Your choices will define her future! </strong><br> <br>Can you be a good parent and guide her well? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little girl knocks on your door in the middle of a rainy night, asking for help. She doesn't remember anything, even her own name. Quickly, you take her in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e32349e91b348b24647908df36e564f8.avif?t=1746601913\" data-has-big width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle the challenge of raising a little girl into adulthood</strong> under the harsh conditions of a Brazilian favela.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/02cd9b094d440477180ac0723c183a24.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the girl's adoptive father or mother!</strong><br><br>Despite the challenges of the location, live a regular life: buy her clothes, furniture and items for her bedroom, change her haircut and more!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/e0ab9d5b13a8fa06d57da00c98886a9a.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/42961e867a476742b5d68149b29caf21.avif?t=1746601913\" data-has-big width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can befriend several kids and even date them later in the game! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a5487b67c47258d583aad7b68e84a449.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks, read library books, attend classes and courses from the community center e and get a job for some extra cash! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/8573f2af57f1dbe388616573c83bd4cb.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to look around everywhere for hidden secrets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.poster.avif?t=1746601913\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.webm?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885290/extras/a630c1956703e7c2b7aa82ecf5bc9014.mp4?t=1746601913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> This game has over 30 different endings!\u00a0Your choices will define her future! </strong><br> <br>Can you be a good parent and guide her well? </p>",
